   {
    "title": "ARC Billing Portal",
    "description": "I have been working as a Billing Developer to build ARC Billing Portal from the scratch like designing MSSQL database tables' schemas, stored procedures, created API calls in Zend Framework, submitting users' transactions to payment gateways like PayPal, Skrill, GlobalCollect, GoogleWallet, Boacompra and created a Payment Processing System to validate, monitor fraud transactions, fulfill transactions directly from these payment gateways.",
    "dateRange": {},
    "associatedWith": "Sep 2013 - Present"
   },
   {
    "title": "Google Wallet payment integration",
    "description": "In late 2013, I was involved with transitioning Perfect World's primary customer-facing website from perfectworld.com to arcgames.com. Even though perfectworld.com would eventually be phased out altogether, this would not be completed before Google's old Checkout payment API was shut down on November 20th of that year. I took the lead on implementing the new Wallet API on perfectworld.com, and successfully launched it in time. Other team members adapted portions of my code for use on the new arcgames.com site.",
    "dateRange": {},
    "associatedWith": "Oct 2013 - Nov 2013"
